 <h3><u>Matam e akbar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>(Haye haye Ali Akbar)..(4)</p> 
  <p>HUSSAIN... HUSSAIN &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Lashaye Akbar jo laye khaymo me<br> Phuphi ne seena o sar peet kar kiya nauha<br> Kohraam mach gaya..</p> 
  <p>(Ya HUSSAIN )..(6)</p> 
  <p>Haan..<br> (khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(1)<br> (ZAINAB yeh bain karti thi Akbar ki laashe par)..(2)<br> Afsos tere............haye<br> Afsos tere laashe par sehra sajaya hai<br> (khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(2)<br> (Aankhein toh kholo aye mere kadiyal jawa'n pisar)..(2)<br> Main jiteji..........haye<br> Main jiteji mar jaungi laila ka nauha hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(3)<br> (Andher hogayi hai yeh duniya tumhare baad )..(2)<br> Laashe pe nauha .............haye<br> Laashe pe nauhakhwan yu ZEHRA ka beta hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(4)<br> (Ghar ka sukoon, aankho'n ki binayi le gaye)..(2)<br> Ab mera kaam.........haye<br> Ab mera kaam bas tere laashe pe rona hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(5)<br> (Aye laal uth bhi jaao ab behno ke waaste)..(2)<br> SUGHRA nahi toh.........haye<br> SUGHRA nahi toh kya hua BALI SAKINA hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(6)<br> (Yeh kehke SHEH ne maanga hai malboos purana )..(2)<br> Akbar&nbsp; ke baad ..........haye<br> Akbar ke baad wese bhi bekaar jeena hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(7)<br> (Akbar tumhare jaane se tanha hue HUSSAIN )..(2)<br> Fizza yeh bain..........haye<br> Fizza yeh bain karti hai SAJJAD rota hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(8)<br> (Irfan AHLE BAIT pe kya kya guzar gayi)..(2)<br> Mazhar ne ek.............haye<br> Mazhar ne ek misre me ehwaal likha hai</p> 
  <p>(khaimo'n me shor matam e Akbar ka hota hai)..(3)</p> 
  <p>(Ya HUSSAIN&nbsp; )..(8)</p> 
